{"channelId":"UCvWcJ_QVLViMthfEAxE6yVg","row":["ParaSkill Med",47100,"ParaSkill Med, operated under the aegis of ADWEF, is a distinguished organization registered under the Ministry of Corporate Affairs, Section 8, Govt. of India, with License No. 159597. Our commitment to quality and excellence is validated by our ISO 9001: 2015 certification. ParaSkill Med is also registered under the Ministry of Social Justice & Empowerment, Govt. of India (ID: DL/00038266), and NITI Aayog (UID: DL/2024/044329), and is recognized under MSME, reflecting our adherence to professional standards and service excellence. Additionally, we are authorized by UGC-approved universities.\n\nAt ParaSkill Med, our mission is to educate and empower individuals in the medical field. We are dedicated to providing high-quality education and training in paramedical sciences through our network of paramedical institutes. Our operations extend to running diagnostic centers, pathology labs, and clinics, delivering essential healthcare services to communities.","","India"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvWcJ_QVLViMthfEAxE6yVg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvWcJ_QVLViMthfEAxE6yVg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:32.785Z","channelId":"UCvWcJ_QVLViMthfEAxE6yVg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"150237aa011663dac1ef3e010552517964864a259b34630eb7660adfce7706d2","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"b5978714afb68db68cd3194e2f8f094f5079309a31d63962d32eb218d3669f5d"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvWcJ_QVLViMthfEAxE6yVg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:32.785Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvWcJ_QVLViMthfEAxE6yVg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":47100,"raw":"47.1K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvWcJ_QVLViMthfEAxE6yVg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:32.785Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"match